[meta]
lang: en
title: OireMark conformance tests: Whitespace
[/meta]

h1. Whitespace

Tests for Section 2 of the specification.

h2. Block Tags Start a Line

h3. Quote tag mid-line is an error {#whitespace-quote-mid-line}
[code om]
h2. Valid Heading

Some text [quote]Invalid — block tag mid-line[/quote]
[/code]
[code error]
block-tag-mid-line 3
[/code]

h3. Note tag mid-line is an error {#whitespace-note-mid-line}
[code om]
Text [note]Not allowed[/note]
[/code]
[code error]
block-tag-mid-line 1
[/code]

h3. Code tag mid-line is an error {#whitespace-code-mid-line}
[code om]
Use the [code] tag for programs.
[/code]
[code error]
block-tag-mid-line 1
[/code]

h3. Table of contents tag mid-line is an error {#whitespace-toc-mid-line}
[code om]
Contents: [toc]
[/code]
[code error]
block-tag-mid-line 1
[/code]

h3. Footnote block tag mid-line is an error {#whitespace-fn-mid-line}
[code om]
Notes follow [fn]
[/code]
[code error]
block-tag-mid-line 1
[/code]

h3. Block lang with content before it is an error {#whitespace-lang-block-mid-line}
[code om]
Some text [lang uk]
Текст українською.
[/lang]
[/code]
[code error]
block-tag-mid-line 1
[/code]

h3. Content after an opening block tag is an error {#whitespace-content-after-opening-tag}
[code om]
[note]Text
[/note]
[/code]
[code error]
block-tag-mid-line 1
[/code]

h3. Closing block tag after content is an error {#whitespace-closing-tag-mid-line}
[code om]
[note]
Text[/note]
[/code]
[code error]
block-tag-mid-line 2
[/code]

h3. Closing lang tag after content is an error {#whitespace-lang-closing-mid-line}
[code om]
[lang fr]
Texte[/lang]
[/code]
[code error]
block-tag-mid-line 2
[/code]

h3. Closing tag with nothing open is an error {#whitespace-stray-closing-tag}
[code om]
Text.

[/quote]
[/code]
[code error]
mismatched-tag 3
[/code]

h3. Escaped tag mid-line is text {#whitespace-escaped-tag-mid-line}
[code om]
Some text \[quote]not a quote
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Some text [quote]not a quote</p>
[/code]

h2. Inline and Block Lang

h3. Content on the same line makes an inline span {#whitespace-lang-inline}
[code om]
Here is [lang fr]texte en français[/lang] in English.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Here is <span lang="fr">texte en français</span> in English.</p>
[/code]

h3. Inline span at the start of a line {#whitespace-lang-inline-line-start}
[code om]
[lang fr]Bonjour[/lang] says the sign.
[/code]
[code html]
<p><span lang="fr">Bonjour</span> says the sign.</p>
[/code]

h3. Unclosed inline lang is literal text {#whitespace-lang-inline-unclosed}
[code om]
Here is [lang fr]texte without an end.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Here is [lang fr]texte without an end.</p>
[/code]

h3. Unclosed inline lang at the start of a line is literal text {#whitespace-lang-inline-unclosed-line-start}
[code om]
[lang fr]Bonjour
[/code]
[code html]
<p>[lang fr]Bonjour</p>
[/code]

h3. Newline after the opening tag makes a block {#whitespace-lang-block}
[code om]
[lang fr]
Ceci est un paragraphe entier en français.
Avec plusieurs lignes.
[/lang]
[/code]
[code html]
<div lang="fr">
  <p>Ceci est un paragraphe entier en français.<br>
  Avec plusieurs lignes.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Block lang may contain a list {#whitespace-lang-block-list}
[code om]
[lang uk]
* Один
* Два
[/lang]
[/code]
[code html]
<div lang="uk">
  <ul>
    <li>Один</li>
    <li>Два</li>
  </ul>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Block lang may contain several paragraphs {#whitespace-lang-block-paragraphs}
[code om]
[lang de]
Erster Absatz.

Zweiter Absatz.
[/lang]
[/code]
[code html]
<div lang="de">
  <p>Erster Absatz.</p>
  <p>Zweiter Absatz.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Inline lang is allowed in the inline profile {#whitespace-lang-inline-profile}
; profile
: inline
[code om]
Say [lang fr]oui[/lang] please
[/code]
[code html]
Say <span lang="fr">oui</span> please
[/code]

h3. Block lang is not allowed in the basic profile {#whitespace-lang-block-basic}
; profile
: basic
[code om]
[lang fr]
Bonjour.
[/lang]
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 1
[/code]

h2. Line Preparation

h3. Trailing spaces are removed {#whitespace-trailing-spaces}
[code hex]
61 20 20 0A 62
[/code]
[code html]
<p>a<br>b</p>
[/code]

h3. Trailing tab is removed {#whitespace-trailing-tab}
[code hex]
61 09 0A 62
[/code]
[code html]
<p>a<br>b</p>
[/code]

h3. Trailing spaces after a heading are removed {#whitespace-trailing-heading}
[code hex]
68 32 2E 20 54 69 74 6C 65 20 20
[/code]
[code html]
<h2 id="title">Title</h2>
[/code]

h3. Trailing spaces are kept inside a code block {#whitespace-trailing-code}
[code hex]
5B 63 6F 64 65 5D 0A 78 20 20 0A 5B 2F 63 6F 64 65 5D
[/code]
[code html]
<pre><code>x&#32;&#32;
</code></pre>
[/code]

h3. Spaces inside a line are kept {#whitespace-inner-spaces}
[code om]
a   b
[/code]
[code html]
<p>a   b</p>
[/code]

h3. A tab inside a line is kept {#whitespace-inner-tab}
[code hex]
61 09 62
[/code]
[code html]
<p>a&#9;b</p>
[/code]

h3. Final newline is ignored {#whitespace-final-newline}
[code hex]
61 0A
[/code]
[code html]
<p>a</p>
[/code]

h3. Final blank lines are ignored {#whitespace-final-blank-lines}
[code hex]
61 0A 0A 20 0A 0A
[/code]
[code html]
<p>a</p>
[/code]

h3. Final newline is ignored in the inline profile {#whitespace-final-newline-inline}
; profile
: inline
[code hex]
61 0A 0A
[/code]
[code html]
a
[/code]

h2. Indentation

h3. Leading spaces on a paragraph line are ignored {#whitespace-indent-paragraph}
[code om]
a
    b
[/code]
[code html]
<p>a<br>b</p>
[/code]

h3. Indented content inside a block is ignored {#whitespace-indent-content}
[code om]
[note]
    This is a note.
[/note]
[/code]
[code html]
<div role="note" class="note">
  <p>This is a note.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Unindented and indented content give the same output {#whitespace-indent-none}
[code om]
[note]
This is a note.
[/note]
[/code]
[code html]
<div role="note" class="note">
  <p>This is a note.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Indented block tags are recognized {#whitespace-indent-tags}
[code om]
    [note]
    This is a note.
    [/note]
[/code]
[code html]
<div role="note" class="note">
  <p>This is a note.</p>
</div>
[/code]

h3. Indented list items are list items {#whitespace-indent-list}
[code om]
  * One
      * Two
[/code]
[code html]
<ul>
  <li>One</li>
  <li>Two</li>
</ul>
[/code]

h3. Indentation inside a code block is preserved {#whitespace-indent-code}
```om
[code]
def hello():
    print("Hello")
[/code]
```
[code html]
<pre><code>def hello():
    print("Hello")
</code></pre>
[/code]
